    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:c3205ac1e20a266d",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "fd3d0045605a79bdb99851322a24505a347c8b79fe7948a8d9c2aec71892e5ef",
      "text": "Day 9 · Breakfast at the hotel. At the scheduled time, transfer to the airport with your driver for your flight to Medellín, known as the City of Eternal Spring. Upon arrival, you will be welcomed by your private English-speaking guide, who will accompany you throughout your stay in Medellín In the afternoon, discover Medellín on a panoramic city tour, exploring a city that has undergone a remarkable transformation and emerged as one of Latin America’s most dynamic centres of culture, innovation and urban development.\n\nThe tour includes Botero Plaza and the Museum of Antioquia, followed by the elegant Rafael Uribe Uribe Palace of Culture and historic Veracruz Church. The experience continues in Comuna 13, now celebrated for its colourful murals, lively streets, outdoor escalators and vibrant urban culture, offering an insight into the remarkable transformation of the neighbourhood. To conclude the day, visit El Castillo Museum, an elegant European-style mansion surrounded by landscaped gardens and home to a collection of fine art, antiques and period furnishings.",
